OL,3,GNEWSAWhere to see Christmas lights in
OL,4,Athe West this year
OL,5,
OL,6,FPortishead: The Christmas Dubs, a
OL,7,Fcommunity of car enthusiasts who
OL,8,Fdecorate their vehicles with lights,
OL,9,Fwill be switching on the Portishead
OL,10,FChristmas lights this year on 23
OL,11,FNovember between 17:40 and 19:00.
